{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1359926-tc-adventure-2e","id":1359926,"title":"TC Adventure! 2E","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Adventure!"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-09T11:36:49-08:00","id":1359926,"title":"TC Adventure! 2E","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/onyx-path-announces-adventure-and-assassins-for-trinity-continuum/\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path announced new-old setting of <b>Trinity Continuum </b>- pulps high <b>Adventure!</b></a> set in this edition in years 1930s! Topic for discussion over setting previews, info and expectations.<br /> <br /> Can someone knowing 1E can made broke strokes what the setting details are?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T11:44:53-08:00","id":1359932,"title":"","content":"Adventure is a pulp action game set in the 30s. It\u2019s centered in the original members of \u00c6on Society of Gentlemen (later \u00c6on Trinity), as they adventure thru the world full of unexplored places and fantastic creatures.<br /> <br /> The idea is, back then, Daredevils (Talents in TC parlance), Stalwards (Porto-Novas) and Mesmerists (Porto-Psiads) are present as well as flux events where other dimensions \u201cinfected\u201d our reality with strange places, like a dinosaur island. As result all the most pulp adventures, from Africa explorers to private detectives are possible.<br /> <br /> The best game of the original Trilogy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T13:17:05-08:00","id":1359953,"title":"","content":"Imagine if all of the movies below existed in the same world: <br /> <br /> - Sky Captain and the World of Tomorrow<br /> - The Indiana Jones Movies (minus Crystal Skull)<br /> - 20,000 Leagues Under the Sea<br /> - The Rocketeer<br /> - The Shadow<br /> - The Phantom<br /> - King Soloman's Mines<br /> <br /> That's basically what the setting is for Adventure!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T16:05:35-08:00","id":1359991,"title":"","content":"This is amazing. Simply amazing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T16:57:12-08:00","id":1360003,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m surprised they\u2019re moving it up to the 30s. You\u2019d think the Great Depression and rise of fascism would detract from the \u201cHope\u201d themes. But maybe they\u2019re going darker to emphasize the NEED for Hope the PCs represent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T17:27:42-08:00","id":1360006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1359926-tc-adventure-2e?p=1360003#post1360003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m surprised they\u2019re moving it up to the 30s. You\u2019d think the Great Depression and rise of fascism would detract from the \u201cHope\u201d themes. But maybe they\u2019re going darker to emphasize the NEED for Hope the PCs represent.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be inclined to make it 20s-30s to use some repurposed Call of Cthulhu scenarios for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T17:31:24-08:00","id":1360007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1359926-tc-adventure-2e?p=1360003#post1360003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m surprised they\u2019re moving it up to the 30s. You\u2019d think the Great Depression and rise of fascism would detract from the \u201cHope\u201d themes. But maybe they\u2019re going darker to emphasize the NEED for Hope the PCs represent.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s my guess. I like it. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24935-werlynn","name":"werlynn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T22:52:37-08:00","id":1360066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1359926-tc-adventure-2e?p=1360003#post1360003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m surprised they\u2019re moving it up to the 30s. You\u2019d think the Great Depression and rise of fascism would detract from the \u201cHope\u201d themes. But maybe they\u2019re going darker to emphasize the NEED for Hope the PCs represent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Really, what could be more hopeful than punching Nazis? Or, hell, going to Germany and trying to prevent the rise of fascism? Or using the Aeon Society\u2019s resources and weird tech to try and help \u201cfix\u201d the Great Depression/the Dust Bowl?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T23:10:25-08:00","id":1360069,"title":"","content":"Wrong thread, sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-13T04:57:44-08:00","id":1360674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1359926-tc-adventure-2e?p=1360003#post1360003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m surprised they\u2019re moving it up to the 30s. You\u2019d think the Great Depression and rise of fascism would detract from the \u201cHope\u201d themes. But maybe they\u2019re going darker to emphasize the NEED for Hope the PCs represent.</div> </div> </div> </div><ul><li>The Shadow: Created in 1930, appears throughout the decade</li> <li>Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom: 1935</li> <li>Raiders of the Lost Ark: 1936</li> <li>Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade: 1938</li> <li>The Phantom: 1938</li> <li>The Rocketeer: 1938</li> </ul>Virtually all of the pulp source material that <b>Adventure!</b> digs into takes place in the 1930s, and usually the latter half of the decade. It was <b>Adventure!</b> 1e that was anomalous in that regard, being set in 1924, a full decade prior to most pulp shenanigans.<br /> <br /> As Adventure! 1e co-dev Bruce Baugh posted elsewhere:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When we were working on plans for the first edition, I lobbied strongly to make it 1920s rather than 1930s, mostly to make Nazi-punchin not be the default activity. I felt that at the time (2001 publication, so the couple of years before for the making), Nazis had too often become basically cartoon, generic figures, trivializing the real nature of their evil and the real extent of their threat. I thought we could do a great pulp game without setting that up as a major option.<br /> <br /> I have never had occasion to regret making that push, either! I continue to think it was the right thing to do then. But, y'know, it's not 2001 anymore. The real-world context is significantly different now. So when Ian told me a little while ago that they were planning to move the game up a decade, I was immediately delighted. Now is a <u>good</u> time to have Nazi-punching be a regular item on the menu for adventurers. That's far from the only benefit to the move, but it's an important one. I'm up for it. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":4,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","user":"IanWatson","date":". 01-13-2020, 08:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-13T11:27:37-08:00","id":1360717,"title":"","content":"As long as I can still play a Ukrainian who punches Communists, I'm happy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-13T11:41:47-08:00","id":1360720,"title":"","content":"There were communists during that period. So you should be fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-13T12:14:56-08:00","id":1360728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1359926-tc-adventure-2e?p=1360717#post1360717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As long as I can still play a Ukrainian who punches Communists, I'm happy.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gra